WEBVTT

00:00.883 --> 00:04.261
- [MAN] Help me. Help me!
- [gasps]

00:04.846 --> 00:06.053
[♪ tense music playing]

00:06.054 --> 00:09.432
Someone! Help me, please!

00:09.433 --> 00:11.811
[gasps, grunts]

00:13.479 --> 00:14.604
Ah!

00:14.605 --> 00:18.150
[yelling]
They're going to kill me!

00:19.151 --> 00:20.778
- Who are you?
- [gasps]

00:21.445 --> 00:22.947
Please, you have to help me.

00:23.280 --> 00:24.489
- Huh?
- [Raanas croaking]

00:24.490 --> 00:25.533
- [yells]
- [Elymas gasps]

00:26.158 --> 00:27.492
[croaking]

00:27.493 --> 00:29.369
[screams]

00:29.370 --> 00:32.122
- [croaking]
- [man shudders]

00:33.039 --> 00:34.917
[whimpering]

00:35.668 --> 00:37.251
- Stand back.
- Huh?

00:37.252 --> 00:40.130
Ah! [whimpers]

00:40.673 --> 00:42.632
Can you really take them down?

00:42.633 --> 00:44.592
[gasps] Even though
you don't look the part,

00:44.593 --> 00:46.929
are you actually
a famous adventurer?

00:48.222 --> 00:49.389
[ELYMAS] No.

00:49.390 --> 00:51.266
Huh?!

00:52.560 --> 00:55.311
In fact, I just leveled up
for the first time

00:55.312 --> 00:56.730
- in my whole life.
- [man gasps]

00:56.731 --> 00:59.774
So you're hopeless?!

00:59.775 --> 01:02.277
Stop! Come back!
You're too weak!

01:03.069 --> 01:04.320
I'm much stronger than you,

01:04.321 --> 01:06.614
and I can't handle
that many monsters!

01:06.615 --> 01:08.909
Now take off that heavy armor!

01:08.910 --> 01:11.662
We have to run!

01:13.205 --> 01:15.457
[ELYMAS] Rampart Reflection
isn't perfect.

01:16.375 --> 01:19.084
My defense needs to be greater
than my opponent's attack

01:19.085 --> 01:20.504
to negate all damage.

01:21.338 --> 01:24.383
If my defense is lower,
then it won't even activate.

01:28.930 --> 01:30.472
Run away!

01:30.932 --> 01:32.348
[croaking]

01:32.349 --> 01:33.642
- [croaks]
- [squeals]

01:34.936 --> 01:37.271
[croaking]

01:37.897 --> 01:41.066
[ELYMAS] It's useless against
superior and unknown foes.

01:41.067 --> 01:42.944
- [croaking]
- But still...

01:43.652 --> 01:46.030
Let's go. Rampart Reflection!

01:46.572 --> 01:49.283
- [grunts]
- [croaking]

01:53.245 --> 01:55.372
Huh?!

01:58.793 --> 02:01.378
[ELYMAS] I'm already familiar
with these starter enemies.

02:02.046 --> 02:03.296
And I've boosted my defense

02:03.297 --> 02:05.339
with skill tree bonuses
and equipment.

02:05.340 --> 02:06.550
[croaking]

02:07.468 --> 02:09.219
I can beat dozens of them.

02:09.553 --> 02:10.846
No problem!

02:12.306 --> 02:13.307
[grunts]

02:14.349 --> 02:16.726
[gasps in disbelief]

02:16.727 --> 02:19.229
[♪ heroic music playing]

02:21.816 --> 02:24.401
- [Elymas sighs]
- [splutters]

02:25.193 --> 02:27.071
[MAN] You brought down
that many?

02:27.488 --> 02:30.407
Wait, who are you?

02:31.826 --> 02:34.119
The name's Elymas Ed--

02:34.120 --> 02:36.871
You're getting exactly
what you deserve.

02:36.872 --> 02:38.790
Don't show your face here again!

02:38.791 --> 02:40.959
If you ever use
the Edvaughn family name

02:40.960 --> 02:42.127
outside of these walls,

02:42.128 --> 02:45.170
I'll have your head
for such insolence!

02:45.171 --> 02:47.090
I'm so sorry.

02:47.091 --> 02:49.467
[huffs frustratedly]

02:49.468 --> 02:51.761
[gasps] Hmm?

02:51.762 --> 02:53.681
- [ELYMAS] No.
- [gasps]

02:56.517 --> 02:57.726
The Heavy Knight,

02:58.060 --> 02:59.145
Elymas.

02:59.895 --> 03:02.940
[♪ opening theme song playing]

04:46.919 --> 04:48.212
[Elymas sighs]

04:59.681 --> 05:00.724
Huh?

05:04.061 --> 05:06.187
[AUTOMATED VOICE] Level Eight
has been reached.

05:06.188 --> 05:08.732
"Unwavering One" title acquired.

05:11.902 --> 05:13.195
[ELYMAS] Display stats.

05:15.281 --> 05:17.782
[ELYMAS] Hmm.
It seems pretty safe to assume

05:17.783 --> 05:20.744
this world's systems work
just like Magic World's do.

05:21.327 --> 05:22.703
Elymas.

05:22.704 --> 05:24.622
I never introduced myself.

05:24.623 --> 05:28.376
I'm Arus, and I left my village
to be an adventurer, but...

05:28.669 --> 05:29.878
Hey, wait.

05:30.420 --> 05:32.839
Uh, I was told
I would never be trusted

05:32.840 --> 05:36.134
unless I was able to go out
and reach Level Three on my own.

05:36.135 --> 05:38.512
I was panicking since
I couldn't get into a party.

05:39.096 --> 05:41.389
But you really saved my neck.

05:43.684 --> 05:46.228
I hope that you will allow me
to thank you.

05:46.937 --> 05:47.895
[Elymas chuckles softly]

05:47.896 --> 05:49.481
- Don't worry about it.
- Huh?

05:50.274 --> 05:52.151
[ELYMAS] That was perfect
for grinding levels.

05:52.776 --> 05:55.402
I will be taking all of
the Magic Stones, though.

05:55.403 --> 05:57.655
Uh, yeah, of course.

05:57.656 --> 05:59.240
So when we get back into town,

05:59.241 --> 06:01.034
do you want
to form a party with me?

06:01.035 --> 06:02.743
'Cause I have
a pretty strong lead, you know?

06:02.744 --> 06:04.578
You must be struggling
to find work

06:04.579 --> 06:05.746
by yourself as well.

06:05.747 --> 06:07.708
Your class isn't too popular.

06:08.917 --> 06:10.543
My son?! No!

06:10.544 --> 06:12.086
It can't be!

06:12.087 --> 06:13.796
- Look, such low stats!
- [gasps]

06:13.797 --> 06:14.881
And they can't fight!

06:14.882 --> 06:17.050
Heavy Knights
are totally worthless!

06:17.051 --> 06:18.176
Everybody knows it's nothing

06:18.177 --> 06:20.136
but a pitiful
and defective class!

06:20.137 --> 06:22.972
[gasps]

06:22.973 --> 06:24.974
But that simply isn't true!

06:24.975 --> 06:26.934
They have the highest HP
and Defense, Father.

06:26.935 --> 06:29.145
That's irrelevant,
just as you are!

06:29.146 --> 06:30.564
- [thuds]
- [groans]

06:31.232 --> 06:33.566
[ARUS] But I think
you're absolutely incredible.

06:33.567 --> 06:36.695
And I have no doubt we would be
just perfect together.

06:37.238 --> 06:40.198
I promise, I'll change
the other people's minds.

06:40.199 --> 06:41.367
[Elymas sighs]

06:41.742 --> 06:43.409
Nah, I'm okay.

06:43.994 --> 06:45.120
[ARUS] What?

06:45.704 --> 06:46.830
But why?

06:47.122 --> 06:49.374
You were using a shield class
fighting style, right?

06:49.375 --> 06:50.415
If you go it alone,

06:50.416 --> 06:51.835
you won't ever be able
to level up.

06:52.336 --> 06:54.504
So, don't be stubborn.

06:55.005 --> 06:56.172
Huh?

06:56.173 --> 06:58.217
[♪ somber music playing]

07:03.513 --> 07:04.932
Sorry.

07:05.307 --> 07:06.516
[sighs heavily]

07:06.975 --> 07:09.353
[ELYMAS] Actually,
he's right about that.

07:10.020 --> 07:11.562
When they're drawing
enemy attacks

07:11.563 --> 07:13.106
and protecting allies,

07:13.107 --> 07:14.607
defensive classes are normally

07:14.608 --> 07:16.526
much more effective
during battle.

07:17.403 --> 07:19.279
But if I just start
dragging along

07:19.280 --> 07:20.696
a bunch of allies,

07:20.697 --> 07:22.949
I'll have to start sharing EXP,

07:22.950 --> 07:25.244
which really sucks
for the way I want to level up.

07:26.203 --> 07:29.706
I'd like to gain different
items, skills, and titles too.

07:30.498 --> 07:32.333
There's a good chance
people won't believe

07:32.334 --> 07:33.627
what I tell them anyway.

07:34.169 --> 07:36.213
[sighs determinately]
But more than that...

07:37.172 --> 07:39.173
I don't have any time
to waste out here.

07:39.174 --> 07:41.385
[Malice laughing]

07:42.177 --> 07:45.430
There are still so many things
left for me to accomplish

07:45.431 --> 07:47.681
if I want to become
a powerful Heavy Knight.

07:47.682 --> 07:48.767
[grunts]

07:50.227 --> 07:52.478
[birds chirping]

07:55.441 --> 07:57.442
[ARUS] Come on, Elymas.

07:57.443 --> 07:59.735
I'm saying this
to try and help you.

07:59.736 --> 08:01.654
Though you're truly amazing,

08:01.655 --> 08:04.991
you're only going to get so far
using your current method.

08:04.992 --> 08:06.033
There's no point

08:06.034 --> 08:07.868
in farming Raana forever,
is there?

08:07.869 --> 08:10.289
Let's aim higher together.

08:10.622 --> 08:11.665
[ELYMAS] Uh.

08:14.626 --> 08:16.378
[gasps] Huh?

08:17.129 --> 08:18.172
[ARUS] Huh?

08:19.006 --> 08:21.049
Huh? Hmm.

08:22.592 --> 08:23.969
[leaves rustling]

08:28.849 --> 08:31.059
[♪ eerie music playing]

08:40.902 --> 08:42.362
[leaves rustling]

08:42.363 --> 08:44.948
Huh? [gasps]

08:47.117 --> 08:49.453
Huh? Huh?

08:58.879 --> 08:59.921
Hmm?

09:00.922 --> 09:02.424
[gasps] Huh?

09:03.425 --> 09:06.011
[creature chittering]

09:12.851 --> 09:14.185
[Arus screams]

09:14.186 --> 09:16.188
[rumbling]

09:17.064 --> 09:19.774
- [screeches]
- [Arus shrieks in terror]

09:20.275 --> 09:22.068
Huh. No way!

09:22.069 --> 09:23.861
What is that doing out here?!

09:23.862 --> 09:25.989
- [screeches]
- [Arus gasps]

09:26.490 --> 09:28.200
[Arus shrieks in terror]

09:28.742 --> 09:30.575
[grunts] Display stats!

09:30.576 --> 09:31.912
[growling]

09:33.539 --> 09:34.789
[ELYMAS] An Ariandype.

09:35.207 --> 09:36.957
Looks like it's double
my current level.

09:36.958 --> 09:38.042
[screeches]

09:38.043 --> 09:39.168
- [whimpers]
- It had been using

09:39.169 --> 09:41.088
its Creepy-Crawly skill to hide.

09:41.880 --> 09:44.382
That thing can also use
slowing poison too.

09:44.383 --> 09:47.511
And its Flaming Claw skill
is also deadly.

09:48.678 --> 09:50.763
Rampart Reflection
is practically useless

09:50.764 --> 09:52.681
against higher-level enemies.

09:52.682 --> 09:55.226
Without a defense that's equal
to double their attack,

09:55.227 --> 09:56.894
it won't be activated.

09:56.895 --> 09:57.979
[whimpering]

09:59.022 --> 10:02.650
If I eat a Flaming Claw,
it'll one-shot me.

10:03.444 --> 10:05.111
I lured it here.

10:05.112 --> 10:07.488
Damn it, it's my fault.

10:07.489 --> 10:09.366
[breathing shakily]

10:11.410 --> 10:12.869
- [grunts]
- [gasps]

10:13.495 --> 10:15.830
I'll keep it busy
so you can escape.

10:16.206 --> 10:17.791
So don't you worry
about a thing.

10:18.750 --> 10:20.710
I'll just, uh...

10:21.753 --> 10:23.589
No, it's all right.

10:25.507 --> 10:27.758
[whimpers] Huh?

10:27.759 --> 10:30.094
- I got this. So just stay back.
- Huh?

10:30.095 --> 10:31.262
Hey, wait!

10:31.263 --> 10:32.472
Stop!

10:32.473 --> 10:34.557
- Are you out of your mind?
- No.

10:34.558 --> 10:35.640
Huh?

10:35.641 --> 10:37.394
[growling]

10:38.562 --> 10:39.605
[ELYMAS] This battle...

10:41.148 --> 10:42.648
isn't unwinnable.

10:44.610 --> 10:46.819
[ARUS] It'd be impossible
for a newbie like you

10:46.820 --> 10:48.237
to take down an Ariandype!

10:48.238 --> 10:50.490
Listen, I know
I said that you're incredible,

10:50.491 --> 10:51.532
and you are.

10:51.533 --> 10:53.159
But you can't do this!

10:53.160 --> 10:55.287
- [growls]
- [ELYMAS] Display stats.

10:56.371 --> 10:57.789
Huh?

10:59.333 --> 11:01.083
[ELYMAS] I've still got
the seven skill points

11:01.084 --> 11:02.294
I gained earlier.

11:03.795 --> 11:05.464
If I want to stand a chance,

11:05.880 --> 11:07.798
I'd better put them all into

11:07.799 --> 11:09.468
Oath of the Heavy Armor!

11:13.597 --> 11:16.433
[AUTOMATED VOICE] The Disarm
skill has now been acquired.

11:17.934 --> 11:20.436
[ELYMAS] The moment I strike
and land a solid hit,

11:20.437 --> 11:23.982
Disarm will temporarily lower
my opponent's attack power.

11:24.399 --> 11:25.650
It drops by 20%

11:25.651 --> 11:27.819
for a one-minute duration,
to be exact.

11:28.987 --> 11:31.822
That's the skill I'll need
to beat the Ariandype.

11:31.823 --> 11:33.032
[grunts]

11:33.033 --> 11:36.077
All right then. Let's go!

11:37.037 --> 11:39.413
- Time for me to take you on!
- [screeches]

11:39.414 --> 11:40.457
Really?

11:44.169 --> 11:45.212
[sighs]

11:47.881 --> 11:50.550
[ELYMAS] The moment I strike
and land a solid hit,

11:50.551 --> 11:53.969
Disarm will temporarily lower
my opponent's attack power.

11:53.970 --> 11:55.762
It drops by 20%

11:55.763 --> 11:57.974
for a one-minute duration,
to be exact.

11:59.142 --> 12:00.267
[sighs]

12:00.268 --> 12:04.314
[grunts] All right then.
Let's go!

12:04.730 --> 12:07.567
- [growls]
- Time for me to take you on!

12:07.568 --> 12:09.068
[growls]

12:09.069 --> 12:11.488
It's high-risk, high reward!

12:12.280 --> 12:13.323
[grunts]

12:13.574 --> 12:16.742
But there's nothing
that fires me up more!

12:17.411 --> 12:19.454
[whooshing]

12:19.787 --> 12:20.830
[ARUS] Huh?

12:22.874 --> 12:24.501
- [screeches]
- [Elymas grunts]

12:27.879 --> 12:28.922
[grunts]

12:33.468 --> 12:35.010
Bring it on, Ariandype!

12:35.011 --> 12:36.345
- [screeches]
- [grunts]

12:36.346 --> 12:38.973
I know its reach
and attack patterns.

12:39.558 --> 12:41.059
I won't get hit that easily.

12:46.690 --> 12:49.192
[roars]

12:50.360 --> 12:52.404
[grunting]

12:53.614 --> 12:55.073
[gasps] What is that?!

13:00.245 --> 13:02.455
[Elymas grunts]
I'll eat this attack...

13:02.456 --> 13:04.708
- [squelching]
- ...on purpose!

13:05.375 --> 13:06.500
Elymas!

13:06.501 --> 13:08.587
[ELYMAS] And then I'll use...
[grunts]

13:09.463 --> 13:11.131
[yells] Disarm!

13:12.591 --> 13:14.092
[growls]

13:14.593 --> 13:16.176
[ELYMAS]
That barely made a dent.

13:16.177 --> 13:18.138
But now
it ought to be debuffed.

13:20.056 --> 13:21.099
[roars]

13:23.059 --> 13:24.102
What? Oh, shit!

13:27.397 --> 13:29.941
[growling]

13:30.400 --> 13:31.652
Look out!

13:36.197 --> 13:37.449
[grunts]

13:38.533 --> 13:39.660
Huh?

13:40.160 --> 13:44.164
[Ariandype growling]

13:45.873 --> 13:48.042
[gasps] Huh?

13:49.043 --> 13:50.210
Elymas.

13:50.211 --> 13:52.088
I'm afraid
that's not gonna work.

13:53.256 --> 13:55.467
Poison Beam costs seven MP.

13:56.301 --> 13:57.885
[sighs, grunts]

13:58.595 --> 14:01.014
And Flaming Claw costs five MP.

14:02.432 --> 14:03.725
[roars]

14:04.934 --> 14:07.312
- [grunts]
- [slashes]

14:07.646 --> 14:10.106
- [yells] Disarm!
- [screeches]

14:11.733 --> 14:13.526
[ELYMAS] That's a second Disarm

14:13.527 --> 14:16.070
and a 40% attack reduction.

14:16.613 --> 14:17.988
When I'm holding position,

14:17.989 --> 14:19.864
the title I earned
after leveling up,

14:19.865 --> 14:22.619
Unwavering One,
buffs my defense by 10%.

14:24.162 --> 14:27.080
Okay. I'm ready to do this.

14:27.081 --> 14:30.751
The differences in our ability
can be overcome using knowledge.

14:30.752 --> 14:32.628
[panting]

14:32.629 --> 14:34.088
Victory is mine!

14:34.422 --> 14:35.841
[Ariandype growling]

14:36.174 --> 14:37.509
- [grunts, yells]
- [sword clangs]

14:38.884 --> 14:40.511
Huh? What the...

14:40.512 --> 14:42.471
[Elymas panting]

14:42.472 --> 14:44.265
[growling]

14:48.144 --> 14:49.646
[grunts]

14:50.146 --> 14:51.439
[growls]

14:52.733 --> 14:54.358
[roars]

14:54.359 --> 14:55.777
[shrieks]

14:56.277 --> 14:58.112
Rampart Reflection!

15:06.621 --> 15:07.873
[whimpers, gasps]

15:11.084 --> 15:12.126
[sighs]

15:13.503 --> 15:15.547
[breathing weakly]

15:20.635 --> 15:22.011
It's all over now.

15:24.222 --> 15:26.433
- [grunts]
- [Ariandype groans]

15:30.687 --> 15:32.979
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level 12 has been reached.

15:32.980 --> 15:35.316
Four skill points acquired.

15:37.694 --> 15:39.821
[pants, gasps]

15:41.907 --> 15:43.824
Additional points
cannot be added

15:43.825 --> 15:46.243
to Oath of the Heavy Armor
at this time.

15:46.244 --> 15:48.161
[ELYMAS]
I've seen this message before.

15:48.162 --> 15:49.996
[groans]
So that Magic World feature

15:49.997 --> 15:51.665
made it out here, too, huh?

15:51.666 --> 15:53.208
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Oath of the Heavy Armor

15:53.209 --> 15:55.210
has reached Level 15.

15:55.211 --> 15:57.046
Parry skill has been acquired.

15:57.380 --> 16:00.090
[ELYMAS] Either way,
now I've got my basic skills.

16:00.091 --> 16:01.634
Uh, seriously,

16:01.635 --> 16:03.510
who in the world are you?

16:03.511 --> 16:04.969
Well, after everything
I've just seen here,

16:04.970 --> 16:07.140
you probably just could
go it alone.

16:07.849 --> 16:09.266
I don't know why I was worried.

16:09.267 --> 16:11.226
It's clear you can take care
of yourself.

16:11.227 --> 16:13.020
[ELYMAS] Sorry, I guess--

16:13.605 --> 16:16.064
[groaning, coughs]

16:16.065 --> 16:19.026
[ARUS] Hey, wait a minute!
You were just poisoned!

16:19.527 --> 16:21.863
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Status effect. Poisoned.

16:22.572 --> 16:26.158
- [ARUS] I'll escort you to town.
- [ELYMAS] Thank you, Arus.

16:26.159 --> 16:27.452
[groans weakly]

16:27.661 --> 16:30.246
[ARUS] As far as I'm concerned,
it's the least I can do.

16:31.205 --> 16:32.248
[ELYMAS] Sorry.

16:32.707 --> 16:34.709
[groaning weakly]

16:36.670 --> 16:38.587
[ARUS]
You saved my life back there.

16:38.588 --> 16:41.465
Hope we meet each other
again one day. [chuckles]

16:41.466 --> 16:43.217
[♪ gentle music playing]

16:48.431 --> 16:49.557
[sighs]

16:53.269 --> 16:54.688
[Elymas groaning]

17:02.111 --> 17:04.864
[gasps]
But that simply isn't true!

17:04.865 --> 17:06.824
They have the highest HP
and Defense, Father.

17:06.825 --> 17:09.242
That's irrelevant,
just as you are!

17:09.243 --> 17:10.578
- [thuds]
- [groans]

17:11.078 --> 17:12.622
Rampart Reflection!

17:16.960 --> 17:18.461
[gasps sharply]

17:20.672 --> 17:23.256
I always thought
Elymas couldn't bear the burden

17:23.257 --> 17:25.175
of being your true heir.

17:25.176 --> 17:28.053
[seething]

17:35.060 --> 17:37.355
[ELYMAS] The day after I
beat the Ariandype,

17:37.939 --> 17:41.191
I made my way down to
the Rondalm Adventurer's Guild

17:41.192 --> 17:43.068
to register as an adventurer.

17:45.989 --> 17:47.448
[indistinct chatter]

17:48.491 --> 17:50.951
[ELYMAS] I'd like to register
as an adventurer.

17:50.952 --> 17:52.161
[indistinct chatter]

17:52.829 --> 17:54.039
[MAN 1] Hmm.

17:55.040 --> 17:56.708
- [MAN 2] Hmm?
- [MAN 3] Huh?

17:57.375 --> 18:00.293
Name's Elymas. I'm Level 12.

18:00.294 --> 18:01.796
My class is Heavy Knight.

18:02.505 --> 18:04.631
I can't believe he'd admit that.

18:04.632 --> 18:07.217
[laughs] Why even bother?

18:07.218 --> 18:09.135
- How embarrassing!
- [all laugh]

18:09.136 --> 18:10.763
[MAN 3]
Heavy Knights are useless!

18:10.764 --> 18:13.974
Oh, I see. So, you're
a defensive class, then.

18:13.975 --> 18:15.518
Yes, sir. Understood.

18:23.818 --> 18:25.904
[AUTOMATED VOICE] F-rank
adventurer Elymas, approved.

18:26.863 --> 18:28.030
[ELYMAS] It's official.

18:28.031 --> 18:30.742
As of right now,
I'm a proper adventurer.

18:32.243 --> 18:34.787
There are seven adventurer ranks
in total.

18:34.788 --> 18:37.414
To enter a dungeon,
it's required that each member

18:37.415 --> 18:39.542
of a party
has at least an E-ranking.

18:41.586 --> 18:43.879
And my ranking determines
the number of skill points

18:43.880 --> 18:45.966
I can add
to Oath of the Heavy Armor.

18:47.258 --> 18:50.804
So, I need to hurry and move up
to E as soon as possible.

18:51.262 --> 18:52.597
Oh, right.

18:55.516 --> 18:57.684
- Hey, look there.
- [gasps]

18:57.685 --> 18:59.394
Do you think that low-level
Heavy Knight's

18:59.395 --> 19:00.814
looking for a party to join?

19:00.939 --> 19:03.774
Who'd let trash like that
be part of their group? [laughs]

19:03.775 --> 19:05.777
[MAN 2] Do any of you
need my help?

19:06.277 --> 19:07.527
There aren't many parties

19:07.528 --> 19:09.113
actively looking
for shield users,

19:09.114 --> 19:12.116
so this may take more time
than you expected.

19:12.117 --> 19:15.078
- [ELYMAS] I see.
- I-I'm sorry about this.

19:15.578 --> 19:18.665
Well, I can always worry about
finding a party later.

19:19.248 --> 19:20.373
But for now...

19:20.374 --> 19:21.417
Huh?

19:23.377 --> 19:25.839
[ELYMAS] I'm glad I was able
to take this Magic Bag.

19:26.255 --> 19:28.633
Seems like it can store
countless items.

19:29.383 --> 19:31.803
I'd like to trade
my Magic Stones.

19:32.345 --> 19:34.388
- [all gasp]
- [MAN 4] What did he say?

19:34.889 --> 19:36.389
[MAN 5] Just look at them.

19:36.390 --> 19:38.725
[gasps] You gathered these

19:38.726 --> 19:40.144
all by yourself?

19:40.145 --> 19:42.270
- [ELYMAS] Yeah. It was just me.
- [gasps]

19:42.271 --> 19:44.773
And be sure to put that down
in your report.

19:44.774 --> 19:47.151
- [all gasp]
- [WOMAN] Huh? Um, okay.

19:47.152 --> 19:48.820
He isn't lying, is he?

19:49.362 --> 19:51.530
What's up
with that Heavy Knight?

19:51.531 --> 19:53.700
Obviously,
the guy's been cheating.

19:54.617 --> 19:55.660
[scoffs]

19:57.620 --> 19:59.329
[ELYMAS] I finished registering,

19:59.330 --> 20:02.000
and I've got enough funds
to cover my living expenses.

20:02.667 --> 20:04.126
What's coming next is enough

20:04.127 --> 20:07.005
to really get my Magic World
player blood pumping!

20:07.672 --> 20:09.048
So would you happen to know

20:09.049 --> 20:10.924
of any promotion quests
that I could take?

20:10.925 --> 20:12.177
Huh?

20:12.886 --> 20:13.969
- Um.
- Hmm?

20:13.970 --> 20:16.596
Well, uh,
yes, I do, technically.

20:16.597 --> 20:17.640
Huh?

20:24.064 --> 20:26.607
- [both breathing anxiously]
- [gulps]

20:29.569 --> 20:31.528
[all breathing nervously]

20:31.529 --> 20:33.531
[♪ ominous music playing]

20:36.659 --> 20:38.619
[both chuckle]

20:43.583 --> 20:44.792
[growls]

20:47.128 --> 20:50.173
[MAN] There's been a lot of talk
about this Raid Quest.

20:50.506 --> 20:53.718
Apparently, a clown has chosen
to join us tonight.

20:54.594 --> 20:56.804
Must be you, Elymas.

20:58.098 --> 21:00.390
There are plenty
of novices like you

21:00.391 --> 21:03.476
who completely underestimate
guilds and monsters.

21:03.477 --> 21:05.478
- [all gasp]
- You managed to beat

21:05.479 --> 21:07.814
an Ariandype at Level 12?

21:07.815 --> 21:09.399
That means nothing to me!

21:09.400 --> 21:12.069
Adventuring isn't so easy!

21:12.070 --> 21:13.737
I'll teach you a lesson!

21:13.738 --> 21:15.573
One you aren't ever
going to forget!

21:18.826 --> 21:20.661
[growls]

21:22.038 --> 21:26.709
[growls]

21:27.543 --> 21:31.089
[growling]

21:32.799 --> 21:34.467
[ELYMAS] Well, this sucks.

21:41.141 --> 21:44.936
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:12.773 --> 23:14.440
[ELYMAS]
I wanted to join a Raid Quest

23:14.441 --> 23:16.568
so I can raise
my adventurer rank

23:16.569 --> 23:18.278
and get past
the current advancement cap

23:18.279 --> 23:19.572
on my skill tree.

23:21.406 --> 23:22.657
But I've had a bad feeling

23:22.658 --> 23:24.576
about this group
since I arrived here.

23:24.577 --> 23:27.079
Some are seasoned and arrogant,

23:27.080 --> 23:28.705
others are new and afraid.

23:28.706 --> 23:30.916
I just hope
nothing happens to us.

23:30.917 --> 23:33.086
Next time, "The Raid Quest."

23:33.460 --> 23:35.587
If we can just back
each other up,

23:35.588 --> 23:37.173
we won't have anything to fear.
